# Local agent/spec tooling. Not part of the build -- nothing in src, CI, or
# package.json references any of it, and it has leaked into main twice now
# (specs/001 with the material-category work, then .agents + .specify + specs/024
# with the HDD branch). Ignored here so a contributor running these tools
# locally can't sweep them in again. Note this only stops NEW commits: a clone
# that already tracks them needs `git rm -r --cached .agents .specify specs`.
.agents/
.specify/
specs/
